const lang=c=>c.A.getLanguage?.()||'tr',text=(c,k)=>words[String(k).replaceAll('-','_')]?.[['tr','az','ru'].indexOf(lang(c))]||c.t(k),esc=(c,x)=>c.e(x);
const title=(c,k,back='discover')=>`<header class="header"><a class="icon-button" href="#${esc(c,back)}" aria-label="${esc(c,text(c,'back'))}">${c.icon('back')}</a><h1 tabindex="-1">${esc(c,text(c,k))}</h1></header>`;
const a=(c,k,path,kind='')=>`<a class="btn ${kind}" href="#${esc(c,path)}">${esc(c,text(c,k))}</a>`;
const btn=(c,k,action,id,extra='')=>`<button type="button" class="btn secondary" data-action="${action}" data-id="${esc(c,id)}" ${extra}>${esc(c,text(c,k))}</button>`;
const submit=(c,k)=>`<button class="btn" type="submit">${esc(c,text(c,k))}</button>`;
const input=(c,k,value='',type='text',attrs='')=>`<label class="field">${esc(c,text(c,k))}<input name="${k}" value="${esc(c,value)}" type="${type}" ${attrs}></label>`;
const select=(c,k,opts,value='')=>`<label class="field">${esc(c,text(c,k))}<select name="${k}">${opts.map(([id,name])=>`<option value="${esc(c,id)}" ${String(id)===String(value)?'selected':''}>${esc(c,name)}</option>`).join('')}</select></label>`;
const area=(c,k,value='')=>`<label class="field">${esc(c,text(c,k))}<textarea name="${k}" maxlength="600">${esc(c,value)}</textarea></label>`;
const hidden=(c,k,v)=>`<input type="hidden" name="${k}" value="${esc(c,v)}">`;
const badge=(c,s)=>`<span class="badge ${['requested','accepted','cancel_requested','quoted'].includes(s)?'warn':''}">${esc(c,text(c,s))}</span>`;
const form=(kind,body)=>{const m=body.match(/<button class="btn" type="submit">([\s\S]*?)<\/button>$/);if(!m||['revision-facility-cancel','revision-quote-decision','revision-cafe-cancel','revision-menu-filter','revision-program-accept','revision-event-accept'].includes(kind))return `<form class="form-stack revision-form" data-form="${kind}">${body}</form>`;const id='form-'+kind;return `<form id="${id}" class="form-stack revision-form" data-form="${kind}">${body.slice(0,-m[0].length)}</form><footer class="flow-footer"><button class="btn" type="submit" form="${id}">${m[1]}</button></footer>`;};
const demo=c=>`<p class="source-note">${esc(c,text(c,'demo'))}</p>`;
const empty=c=>`<div class="empty"><p>${esc(c,text(c,'empty'))}</p></div>`;
